{"title":"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> except <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/e/3ae6f65b1441e7d971c95b3b14263c0184156fb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x/(x-1))=1/x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />. Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/0/b80e0311482f373fa8db9d04e82cf70a67c82add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq t\\leq \\pi/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc814801d24d590ad5e197d233ec93d68aa56c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\sec^2t)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"19\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/8/1c8871113d26b2b1f2467df922d47c5055da4b68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\sin^2 t \\quad \\text{(B) } \\cos^2 t \\quad \\text{(C) } \\tan^2 t \\quad \\text{(D) } \\cot^2 t \\quad \\text{(E) } \\csc^2 t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"442\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/a/7cac5a2c72876b74832d9b6c4b557a8aecb1f9e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{x}{x-1} \\Rightarrow xy-y=x \\Rightarrow x=\\frac{y}{y-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"300\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/f/47febf6147524b709b07896028d20225cc226d4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y)=\\frac{1}{x}=\\frac{y-1}{y}=1-\\frac{1}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"210\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/5/8f5fdc5f8fba96c915df9ad2945699558022c087.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(\\sec^2t)=\\sin^2t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"